                                            *                     usbdsc.c should be updated to call all available          C:\Projects\UBW\FW\2455\B\system\usb\usbctrltrf\usbctrltrf.c
                                            *                     class handlers.                                           C:\Projects\UBW\FW\2455\B\system\usb\usbctrltrf\usbctrltrf.c
                                            *                  3. Once each of the modules has had a chance to check if     C:\Projects\UBW\FW\2455\B\system\usb\usbctrltrf\usbctrltrf.c
