                                            *                     then checks direction of the transfer to determine how    C:\Projects\UBW\FW\2455\B\system\usb\usbctrltrf\usbctrltrf.c
                                            *                     to prepare EP0 for the control transfer.                  C:\Projects\UBW\FW\2455\B\system\usb\usbctrltrf\usbctrltrf.c
