                                            *                                                                               C:\Projects\UBW\FW\2455\B\system\usb\usbctrltrf\usbctrltrf.c
                                            * Note:            Microchip USB Firmware has three different states for        C:\Projects\UBW\FW\2455\B\system\usb\usbctrltrf\usbctrltrf.c
                                            *                  the control transfer state machine:                          C:\Projects\UBW\FW\2455\B\system\usb\usbctrltrf\usbctrltrf.c
                                            *                  1. WAIT_SETUP                                                C:\Projects\UBW\FW\2455\B\system\usb\usbctrltrf\usbctrltrf.c
